title: "tsv-to-sysmlv2: deterministic SysML 1.7 to SysML v2 converter"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-01
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX
repository-code: "https://github.com/MB-DIRECT/tsv-to-sysmlv2"
license: MIT
authors:
