keywords:
  - SysML
  - SysML v2
  - MBSE
  - model migration
  - CATIA Magic
abstract: >-
  Converts a SysML 1.7 model exported from CATIA Magic / MSOSA 2026x
  (33-column TSV from the included Report Wizard) into SysML v2
  textual notation, and writes a migration report of every element,
  property and diagram that could not be migrated automatically.
  Supporting software for the doctoral praxis "Metamodel Scope Using Model-Based Decision on Intended-Use & Requirements Engineering Categorization Tool (MB-DIRECT)".
